// program name is pinned to the reference executable's. The program name is
// environment-derived in both languages (basename of argv[0] in CPython,
// basename of the script under Node), and its *length* feeds the usage-wrapping
// arithmetic — so holding it equal is what lets the formatter be compared
// byte for byte.
import {
  ArgparseExit,
